        <body>
            <div xml:id="d110">

                <pb facs="0205" n="859" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg859"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr. Sutter.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1875-01-27"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi>
                        27</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">John A. Sutter</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">American Consul, Acapulco:</hi></p>
                <p>The government assures me it will take prompt and vigorous measures for
                    punishment and will afford all necessary protection to Mr. Hutchinson. Keep me
                    advised of events, briefly by telegraph and in detail by mail.</p>
                <closer><signed>JOHN W. FOSTER.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
